  "status_text": "These two sets of lights demand at least six gates, even when every gate can flip a bit. Lean checked this on the five rows made by turning on four switches in order from all off. The three wires cannot show patterns (4,18,20) together, or (6,17,20) together, with five or fewer AND/OR/NOT gates reading at most two wires each. Each number records one wire across the five rows, with the first row in the low bit. Two constants are free, every gate counts, and the three wire choices are unrestricted (L-lib-1304).",
